<!DOCTYPE html>
<html metal:use-macro="context/@@pfas-macros/macros/page"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"
      xmlns:tal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/tal"
      xmlns:metal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/metal">
<head>
  <title metal:fill-slot="title">Reference Weight Sets</title>
  <tal:styles metal:fill-slot="head-extra">
  <style>
    .log-form { background:var(--s-bg); border:1px solid var(--s-border);
                border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:18px; }
    .log-form h3 { font-size:var(--fs-base); font-weight:700; margin:0 0 4px; color:var(--s-body); }
    .log-form .hint { font-size:var(--fs-xs); color:var(--s-secondary); margin:0 0 12px; }
    .fld { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:3px; margin-bottom:10px; }
    .fld label { font-size:var(--fs-xs); font-weight:600; color:var(--s-secondary); }
    .fld input, .fld select { padding:6px 8px; font-size:var(--fs-base);
                 border:1px solid var(--s-input-border); border-radius:4px;
                 color:var(--s-input-text); }
    .fld-row { display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .fld-row .fld { flex:1; min-width:140px; }
    .chk { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font-size:var(--fs-sm);
           color:var(--s-body); margin-bottom:10px; }
    .log-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:var(--fs-sm); }
    .log-table th { background:var(--s-light); padding:7px 10px; font-size:var(--fs-xs);
                    font-weight:700; color:var(--s-secondary);
                    border-bottom:2px solid var(--s-border); text-align:left; }
    .log-table td { padding:7px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--s-border);
                    vertical-align:top; }
    .p-ok  { background:#d4edda; color:#155724; padding:2px 9px; border-radius:8px;
             font-size:var(--fs-xs); font-weight:700; }
    .p-fail { background:#f8d7da; color:#721c24; padding:2px 9px; border-radius:8px;
              font-size:var(--fs-xs); font-weight:700; }
    .why { background:var(--s-light); border-left:3px solid var(--s-border);
           padding:10px 14px; font-size:var(--fs-sm); color:var(--s-secondary);
           margin-bottom:18px; border-radius:0 4px 4px 0; }
    .prob { color:#8a1c1c; font-size:var(--fs-xs); display:block; }
  </style>
  </tal:styles>
</head>
<body>
<tal:t metal:fill-slot="header-title">Reference Weight Sets</tal:t>
<metal:content metal:fill-slot="content">
  <tal:def tal:define="purl view/portal_url; today view/today">

  <div class="why">
    A balance verification is only as good as the weights it was performed with.
    These sets are calibrated by an <strong>external metrology laboratory</strong>
    &mdash; the point where the equipment chain leaves this laboratory, the same
    way a reagent's chain ends at its manufacturer's certificate. A set with no
    certificate, an expired calibration, or no NIST traceability makes every
    balance verification performed with it untraceable, and the Data Review
    traceability gate will reject the affected worksheets. All dates ISO 8601.
  </div>

  <p class="hint" tal:condition="not:view/can_configure">
    Weight sets and their metrology certificates are lab configuration: a
    Manager or LabManager records them.
  </p>

  <div class="log-form" tal:condition="view/can_configure">
    <h3>Add / update a weight set</h3>
    <p class="hint">Leave the identifier of an existing set unchanged to update it.</p>
    <form method="POST" tal:attributes="action string:${purl}/@@pfas-weight-sets">
      <input type="hidden" name="action" value="save" />
      <input type="hidden" name="id" value="" tal:attributes="value request/form/id|nothing" />
      <div class="fld-row">
        <div class="fld"><label>Set identifier *</label>
          <input type="text" name="set_id" required placeholder="WS-001" /></div>
        <div class="fld"><label>Weight class</label>
          <input type="text" name="weight_class" placeholder="ASTM Class 1 / OIML E2" /></div>
        <div class="fld"><label>Serial number</label>
          <input type="text" name="serial_number" /></div>
      </div>
      <div class="fld"><label>Description</label>
          <input type="text" name="description" placeholder="1 mg - 100 g, 12 weights" /></div>

      <h3 style="margin-top:14px">External calibration (metrology laboratory)</h3>
      <p class="hint">Required. Without it the set establishes no traceability.</p>
      <div class="fld-row">
        <div class="fld"><label>Calibration laboratory *</label>
          <input type="text" name="cal_lab" required /></div>
        <div class="fld"><label>Its accreditation</label>
          <input type="text" name="cal_lab_accreditation"
                 placeholder="ISO/IEC 17025, scope no." /></div>
        <div class="fld"><label>Certificate number *</label>
          <input type="text" name="cal_cert_number" required /></div>
      </div>
      <div class="fld-row">
        <div class="fld"><label>Calibration date *</label>
          <input type="date" name="cal_date" required /></div>
        <div class="fld"><label>Calibration due *</label>
          <input type="date" name="cal_due_date" required /></div>
      </div>
      <div class="chk">
        <input type="checkbox" name="nist_traceable" value="1" checked="checked"
               id="nist" />
        <label for="nist" style="font-size:var(--fs-sm)">Calibration is NIST-traceable</label>
      </div>
      <div class="chk">
        <input type="checkbox" name="active" value="1" checked="checked" id="act" />
        <label for="act" style="font-size:var(--fs-sm)">In service</label>
      </div>
      <div class="fld"><label>Notes</label><input type="text" name="notes" /></div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Save weight set</button>
    </form>
  </div>

  <h3 style="font-size:var(--fs-base);margin:0 0 8px">Registered sets</h3>
  <table class="log-table">
    <thead><tr>
      <th>Set</th><th>Class</th><th>Calibration laboratory</th>
      <th>Certificate</th><th>Calibrated</th><th>Due</th><th>Status</th>
    </tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tal:rows tal:repeat="ws view/weight_sets">
      <tr>
        <td><strong tal:content="ws/set_id">WS-001</strong>
            <span tal:condition="ws/description|nothing" style="color:var(--s-secondary)"
                  tal:content="string: — ${ws/description}"></span></td>
        <td tal:content="ws/weight_class|string:—">—</td>
        <td tal:content="ws/cal_lab|string:—">—</td>
        <td tal:content="ws/cal_cert_number|string:—">—</td>
        <td tal:content="ws/cal_date|string:—">—</td>
        <td tal:content="ws/cal_due_date|string:—">—</td>
        <td>
          <span tal:condition="not:ws/problems" class="p-ok">TRACEABLE</span>
          <tal:bad tal:condition="ws/problems">
            <span class="p-fail">NOT TRACEABLE</span>
            <span class="prob" tal:repeat="p ws/problems" tal:content="p"></span>
          </tal:bad>
        </td>
      </tr>
      </tal:rows>
      <tr tal:condition="not:view/weight_sets">
        <td colspan="7" style="color:var(--s-secondary)">
          No weight sets recorded. Until one is, every balance verification traces
          to nothing.
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  </tal:def>
</metal:content>
</body>
</html>
